Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.15,0:00:02.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)哥尔贡守护者
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.74,0:00:03.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.64,0:00:10.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)为什么 你会 在这里…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.37,0:00:12.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)我是追着你们来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.17,0:00:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是想在这里做个了断吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.37,0:00:20.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多鲁贝… 难道无论如何
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:21.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我都非得和你战斗不可吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.35,0:00:23.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}事到如今还说什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.66,0:00:25.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.71,0:00:27.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你救过我们。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.22,0:00:30.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那时候 在那个遗迹里要是没有你在{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.05,0:00:32.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们不知道会变成什么样…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.05,0:00:34.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.18,0:00:37.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那只是你一厢情愿的想法。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.97,0:00:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底我们就是注定要战斗的宿命。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.58,0:00:42.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 多鲁贝。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.10,0:00:45.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遗迹里的传说说的就是你们吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.77,0:00:49.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然我不知道发生了什么{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.80,0:00:52.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但你们原本和我们一样都是人类啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.70,0:00:56.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此 为什么非得和
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.19,0:00:57.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体战斗不可啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.02,0:00:58.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别开玩笑了!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.59,0:01:03.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们曾经是人类什么的这种话 我绝不相信！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.36,0:01:08.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶界是与星光界成对的世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.98,0:01:12.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且是被命运注定要与之敌对的世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.57,0:01:13.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么啊 那岂不是…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.33,0:01:15.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那你和星光体{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.47,0:01:18.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不都是不知道战斗的真正意义吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.71,0:01:21.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别为了这种无聊的事情战斗啊!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.89,0:01:25.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光体)游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.39,0:01:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管你怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.49,0:01:31.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们不会共同生存下去。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.12,0:01:33.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对吧？Astral。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.68,0:01:36.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的使命是…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.05,0:01:39.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毁灭异晶界。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.52,0:01:42.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…Astral…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.36,0:03:27.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.19,0:03:30.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又是这个幻觉…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.13,0:03:34.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}国王陛下，向您报告。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.00,0:03:37.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}各方面的战况，我军处于劣势…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.03,0:03:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔军使用戈耳工
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.99,0:03:41.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接连突破我军的防线。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.48,0:03:45.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻入我国城下也只是时间问题…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.68,0:03:52.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去，别说我国了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.80,0:03:55.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}邻近诸国的所有民众都将被赶尽杀绝…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:03:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以，要我做什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.86,0:03:59.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（璃绪）哥哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.99,0:04:03.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（璃绪）大家都在等着哥哥的指示。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.72,0:04:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.16,0:04:07.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是的。这个国家的国王，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.39,0:04:10.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也是指导者，就是哥哥你的指示。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.03,0:04:13.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别开玩笑了！指导者？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.72,0:04:15.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别把你们的人生强加到我头上！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.49,0:04:17.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}国……国王……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.99,0:04:20.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？哥哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.07,0:04:23.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥不是一直统领着
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.65,0:04:26.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这片波塞冬海联合国的指导者吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.68,0:04:29.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一直守护着这个世界的和平！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.48,0:04:32.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我？ 就我……。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.16,0:04:34.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿比斯)跨越过去吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.64,0:04:39.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跨越试炼吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.75,0:04:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个世界的战斗还有决斗都要赢下来。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.59,0:04:47.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如此一来 你就能……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.92,0:04:49.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闭嘴！！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.79,0:04:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的试炼……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.04,0:04:55.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}国王……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.30,0:04:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.13,0:04:59.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}镜子？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.28,0:05:03.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…才不是什么领导者。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.54,0:05:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但就算在这种世界，就算是决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.93,0:05:09.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}输了也让人火大啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.36,0:05:12.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让士兵们装备新的武装！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.27,0:05:20.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《刚才的幻觉也是 那家伙对我？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.56,0:05:23.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这幻觉到底是…》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.96,0:05:26.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 就这样 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.91,0:05:29.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《不过 刚才那个 倒是派上用场了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.80,0:05:31.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥尔贡是靠自己的力量灭亡的。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.44,0:05:34.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此 我也一定有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.63,0:05:35.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能打破这个局面的卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.64,0:05:39.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你为了考验我而给我的卡…》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.86,0:05:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.83,0:05:48.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动速攻魔法 绝对零度！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.83,0:05:52.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将超量素材为零的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.34,0:05:54.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只超量怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.24,0:05:54.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成零！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.49,0:05:58.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没用的，我的怪兽的装备魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.47,0:06:00.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量单元是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.59,0:06:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在使用超量单元的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.82,0:06:04.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来发动的情况下{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.55,0:06:06.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以作为其替代。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.35,0:06:11.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很遗憾，即使通过效果能够使用它{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.50,0:06:14.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张卡也不是超量单元。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.57,0:06:16.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此，根据绝对零度的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.11,0:06:18.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}戈尔贡守护者的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.94,0:06:19.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成零！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.22,0:06:23.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，在这个瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.26,0:06:25.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}戈尔贡守护者的效果发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.60,0:06:29.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上的攻击力为零的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.06,0:06:29.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会被破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.55,0:06:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用你自己的力量毁灭吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.87,0:06:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是现在！ 出镜之盾!!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.60,0:07:02.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不知道你在试探什么……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.02,0:07:06.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！ 我召唤深渊鲨。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.15,0:07:08.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.82,0:07:10.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在场上没有怪兽的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.78,0:07:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不需要解放就能召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.28,0:07:16.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用深渊鲨鱼 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.31,0:07:25.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.03,0:07:29.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 做个了断吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.86,0:07:32.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.33,0:07:34.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德鲁贝…… 在决斗之前
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.95,0:07:36.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我有一件事想问你。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.55,0:07:39.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安七皇之中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.45,0:07:41.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有我们尚未遇见的两个人。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.75,0:07:44.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这座遗迹里 大概
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.15,0:07:45.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}应该残留着
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.17,0:07:46.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些人的传说……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.54,0:07:51.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么那两个人不现身在我们面前？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.25,0:07:55.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那两人正是我们巴利安七皇的首领
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.55,0:07:57.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纳修 还有 梅拉格……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.73,0:08:00.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们一定 还活着。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.89,0:08:02.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 他们会回来的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.90,0:08:04.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.25,0:08:06.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什…什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.46,0:08:11.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什…什么情况！？那是什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.33,0:08:15.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那…那是鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.08,0:08:17.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙 难道说…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.78,0:08:19.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗已经开始了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.28,0:08:24.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！鲨鱼的妹妹！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.01,0:08:27.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那鲨鱼的决斗对手就是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.26,0:08:32.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么那帮家伙会在这遗迹里决斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.27,0:08:35.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟你们的了断 下次再说！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.97,0:08:37.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂…喂！等等！！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.29,0:08:40.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好痛…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.40,0:08:43.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可…可恶！居然飞走 太卑鄙了！！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.23,0:08:45.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们也得去鲨鱼那边才行。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.42,0:08:50.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但为此必须先走出这座迷宫…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.13,0:08:51.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.30,0:08:58.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《多鲁贝在 这座迷宫里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.62,0:09:00.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进来的时候 打开的那个洞……》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.25,0:09:02.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！ 是卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.83,0:09:03.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.98,0:09:05.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把针剑士放到下面。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.11,0:09:07.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把针剑士？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.00,0:09:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解释之后再说。 快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.67,0:09:14.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《神代凌牙……》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.85,0:09:18.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.91,0:09:22.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个瞬间 深渊鲨鱼的效果 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.25,0:09:24.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.66,0:09:26.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}仅在对方回合 变为两倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.11,0:09:30.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赶紧 给这场决斗做个了断！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.88,0:09:32.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会那么顺利吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.53,0:09:35.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了 去追针剑士。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.64,0:09:38.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此！ 水是从上往下……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.18,0:09:41.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}水流向的地方就是迷宫的出口！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.10,0:09:46.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.50,0:09:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}戈尔贡尼安·仪式。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.35,0:09:50.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡将墓地的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.77,0:09:53.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}岩石族怪兽从额外卡组除外。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.84,0:09:56.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将「大磁炎守护者」除外。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.75,0:09:59.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后从墓地选岩石族怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.12,0:10:01.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}2只以守备表示特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.97,0:10:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧，「磁炎魔像」！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.94,0:10:04.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}「磁炎石像鬼」！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.38,0:10:06.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.82,0:10:08.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}「磁炎堆叠」。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.30,0:10:11.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我场上每有1只
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.44,0:10:13.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}名字带有「磁炎」的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.35,0:10:15.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就提升1个等级。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.66,0:10:17.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上的磁炎怪兽有2只。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.19,0:10:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此，等级提升2个。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.29,0:10:21.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要来了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.47,0:10:25.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙，唤醒你的记忆吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.52,0:10:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.67,0:10:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}磁炎因敌人的镜之盾而{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.06,0:10:34.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接连被破坏…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.42,0:10:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那群家伙趁势追击{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开始了反击
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.32,0:10:38.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去，我军就……。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.04,0:10:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（贝库塔）把那家伙打落海中！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.94,0:10:47.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我身边还有全能之神在。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.81,0:10:53.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，以血的代价作为交换把你的力量借给我！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.03,0:10:58.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，全能之神！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.22,0:10:59.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.47,0:11:09.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好好看着吧，凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.35,0:11:13.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我以等级5的哥尔贡尼克·魔像和
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.39,0:11:14.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}石像鬼叠放超量。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.59,0:11:16.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.88,0:11:19.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.47,0:11:20.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.07,0:11:24.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃，怎么回事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.04,0:11:28.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.73！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.11,0:11:37.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（璃绪）坠入混沌的圣洁之滴。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.25,0:11:41.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}展现其力，净化混沌吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.28,0:11:45.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}激泷神 深渊·飞沫！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.40,0:11:49.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙就是遗迹的 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.96,0:11:56.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.56,0:11:59.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场地上到底发生了什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.14,0:12:02.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.26,0:12:08.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.10,0:12:10.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈……这里是，难道是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.83,0:12:12.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遗迹的记忆之中！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.47,0:12:19.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(杜尔伯)为什么，为什么我会……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.89,0:12:21.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.76,0:12:24.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神代凌牙也在这段记忆之中。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.28,0:12:27.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个吊坠是！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.68,0:12:31.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)海之神竟然站到了那个贝库塔那边……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.29,0:12:35.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恐怕是以血为代价与神签订了契约……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.73,0:12:39.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要净化那个的话……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.92,0:12:51.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}国王！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.40,0:13:02.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)璃绪！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.75,0:13:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪……璃绪！！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.79,0:13:15.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.70,0:13:19.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈 璃绪！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.62,0:13:29.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.62,0:13:30.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿比斯)神代凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.54,0:13:34.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从现在起你真正的试炼即将开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.68,0:13:37.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吾名乃阿比斯。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.68,0:13:40.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿比斯)正是现在正是考验你力量之时。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.20,0:13:42.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.49,0:13:46.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.73 阿比斯·飞溅的效果发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.92,0:13:49.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.23,0:13:52.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗期间 攻击力变为2倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.05,0:13:55.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 4800吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.54,0:13:59.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 你就完了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.52,0:14:01.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 阿比斯·飞溅！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.54,0:14:03.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击深渊鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.85,0:14:05.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最终之落！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.21,0:14:12.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动 隐藏与鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.50,0:14:16.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡自己生命值在2000以下时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.30,0:14:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方的怪兽发起攻击时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.66,0:14:20.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将场上冠有「鲨」之名的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.62,0:14:21.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽除外，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.29,0:14:23.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结束战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.35,0:14:27.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但作为代价，我要支付一半的生命值。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.52,0:14:35.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总算是撑过去了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.22,0:14:40.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}「躲藏与鲨鱼」的进一步效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.25,0:14:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗结束时，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.24,0:14:44.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将除外的怪兽放回场上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.36,0:14:48.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并按照发动卡片所支付的生命值等量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.17,0:14:50.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升怪兽的攻击力。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.93,0:14:52.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把怪兽复活了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.30,0:14:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 到此回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.85,0:14:59.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 凭这点力量是打不倒我的怪兽的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.87,0:15:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}向我投降吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.31,0:15:18.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}否则 你这家伙的妹妹就将会如海中泡沫般消散。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.87,0:15:29.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙是 德鲁贝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.15,0:15:33.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吾友啊 为何惊讶。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.56,0:15:37.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你以为我 在你危急之时不会赶来吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.89,0:15:39.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说你是我朋友……？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.71,0:15:42.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还愣着干什么 把那家伙射下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.11,0:15:49.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会… 我竟在过去与凌牙…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.01,0:15:54.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 做出选择是要救妹妹还是救国家！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.84,0:15:58.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要解开邪恶的咒印{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.54,0:16:02.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只能以神圣的代价来净化神明。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.23,0:16:04.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪 你 要做什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.56,0:16:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥 我的灵魂会净化深渊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.22,0:16:11.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.92,0:16:21.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.05,0:16:27.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是 遗迹的新 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.34,0:16:30.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道 鲨鱼和璃绪是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.46,0:16:33.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是纳修和梅拉格吗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.26,0:16:38.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会… 刚才那是我的记忆。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.65,0:16:42.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我难道没能救下璃绪吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.58,0:16:48.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这片领域就是你的内心本身。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.88,0:16:53.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你将会再次在这个世界里失去妹妹。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.67,0:17:00.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你内心的软弱会让你失去所有重要之物。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.46,0:17:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.43,0:17:06.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.39,0:17:09.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}热血沸腾啊 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.01,0:17:21.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼 妹妹我帮你救下了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.74,0:17:24.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放心大胆地 把那家伙揍飞吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.08,0:17:25.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.88,0:17:31.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是璃绪化身的 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.91,0:17:38.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 凌牙 打倒我取回自己的记忆{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.58,0:17:41.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为王 引导世界吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.73,0:17:44.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少开玩笑了。我 谁都不是。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.23,0:17:46.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就是我！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.68,0:17:49.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.00,0:17:51.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.87,0:17:54.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动装备魔法 水镜。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.95,0:17:57.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡装备在水属性怪兽上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.99,0:18:00.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将装备的怪兽作为超量素材时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.25,0:18:03.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以作为与装备怪兽相同等级的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.62,0:18:05.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽来作为超量素材。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.84,0:18:09.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 发动魔法卡 死者苏生！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.43,0:18:12.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧 黑枪兵。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.91,0:18:15.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动陷阱。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.49,0:18:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全副武装超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.07,0:18:20.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡以自己场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.92,0:18:22.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.27,0:18:23.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为对象发动{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.76,0:18:25.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}首先进行超量召唤
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.30,0:18:27.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对象怪兽装备到召唤出的怪兽上。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.18,0:18:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 将其攻击力装备到装备怪兽上。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.89,0:18:34.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我选择的对象是黑光枪兵。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.34,0:18:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级5的深渊鲨鱼和
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.34,0:18:39.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}水镜精灵进行叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.60,0:18:41.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用两只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.90,0:18:43.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.65,0:18:45.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.38,0:18:50.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.94！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.90,0:18:56.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}身披冰之心，灵界的巫女展现澄澈的灵魂吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.33,0:19:00.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}极冰姬 水晶零！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.74,0:19:08.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动全装甲超量的效果，
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.53,0:19:11.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将黑光枪兵装备到水晶零上！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.91,0:19:17.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.45,0:19:20.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}水晶零的攻击力提升到4300！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.31,0:19:22.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没那么容易。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.56,0:19:25.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动深渊溅射的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.66,0:19:27.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消耗一个叠放单位，
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.88,0:19:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让攻击力翻倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.80,0:19:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太天真了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.67,0:19:33.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 水晶零的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.68,0:19:35.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量单元
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.60,0:19:38.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方怪兽的攻击力减半！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.65,0:19:40.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我使用2个超量单元！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.38,0:19:43.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}水晶·抹除者！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.08,0:19:48.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来深渊·飞溅的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.30,0:19:49.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就变成1200了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.86,0:19:52.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 水晶零！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.07,0:19:55.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把深渊·飞溅给粉碎掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.80,0:19:57.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}水晶·标枪！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.55,0:20:14.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功了 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.52,0:20:16.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.05,0:20:19.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么要对我和璃绪 做这种事…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.41,0:20:23.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不过是 遵从了你的命令而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.40,0:20:27.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唤醒你记忆的这个命令而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.60,0:20:29.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的命令！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.63,0:20:32.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂！ 怎么回事？ 喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.04,0:20:37.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这就是我的 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.65,0:20:39.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会吧 怎么会……》
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.22,0:20:42.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神代凌牙 璃绪……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.52,0:20:46.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什……什么啊 这是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.04,0:20:52.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)大家……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.66,0:20:56.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.84,0:21:01.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？ 小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.75,0:21:02.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 大家！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.30,0:21:04.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们 回来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.33,0:21:06.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.74,0:21:10.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.37,0:21:14.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)璃绪！！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.89,0:21:22.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(千尊)看来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.47,0:21:23.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}剩下的２张 No.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.03,0:21:26.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经落到阿斯特拉尔他们手里了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.27,0:21:28.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.95,0:21:30.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(千尊)不过 放心吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.81,0:21:33.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那２张迟早会回到我们手中。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.48,0:21:37.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…… 你这家伙到底你知道什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.10,0:21:41.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部。包括你的一切。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.34,0:21:44.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就像你在那座遗迹里感觉到的那样{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.22,0:21:48.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你曾经是人类这件事也是。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.68,0:21:49.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)就凭我？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.79,0:21:54.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有你转生到巴利安世界
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.63,0:21:57.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}杀死了纳修和梅拉格这件事也是。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.39,0:22:00.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.17,0:22:03.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(上千主上)比起那种事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.33,0:22:04.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去找 No.96。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.32,0:22:08.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙差不多该行动了。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.34,0:23:43.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.37,0:23:47.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.88,0:23:51.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.84,0:23:53.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.35,0:23:54.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.83,0:23:56.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.98,0:23:59.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
